    "detailed_description": "<h1>MORE GAMES FROM US</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1713179908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>This camping has seen better days, and now it\u2019s up to you to make it a fantastic holiday spot once again. Camping Builder is a next-gen simulator with polished mechanics, an environment full of life, and an engaging story.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/91bf447b410eb31dcdfc4b8e414a2ea3.webp?t=1713179908\" /></div><br>You can gather materials and use them to rebuild the bungalows, then decorate them to your liking and wait for the guests to arrive!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/1c09a1b5b5fa7520f697168a19c94107.poster.avif?t=1713179908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/1c09a1b5b5fa7520f697168a19c94107.webm?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/cff63be2edb23fb97fb048ea69d9378a.webp?t=1713179908\" /></div><br>Pick up the trash and throw it away into the dedicated containers. You can also decide just to burn it or dump it into the ocean, risking the island\u2019s wrath.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/55dd1f5c0f833286491fa3efffa97300.poster.avif?t=1713179908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/55dd1f5c0f833286491fa3efffa97300.webm?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/00d69175af944d891ccba93100be4cfc.webp?t=1713179908\" /></div><br>You can cut down trees, but make sure to plant new ones! The Camping Builder is all about balance.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/4519e5c7906e3f61b075d7312fcf3284.poster.avif?t=1713179908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/4519e5c7906e3f61b075d7312fcf3284.webm?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/b8ef609e39ac6494752610b15599d187.webp?t=1713179908\" /></div><br>Find out more about this beautiful place, meet its inhabitants and discover its mysteries. Fall in love with the world and the story.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/b656879d89598ff9803e4f057cdb1bac.poster.avif?t=1713179908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/b656879d89598ff9803e4f057cdb1bac.webm?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1713179908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>This camping has seen better days, and now it\u2019s up to you to make it a fantastic holiday spot once again. Camping Builder is a next-gen simulator with polished mechanics, an environment full of life, and an engaging story.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/91bf447b410eb31dcdfc4b8e414a2ea3.webp?t=1713179908\" /></div><br>You can gather materials and use them to rebuild the bungalows, then decorate them to your liking and wait for the guests to arrive!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/1c09a1b5b5fa7520f697168a19c94107.poster.avif?t=1713179908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/1c09a1b5b5fa7520f697168a19c94107.webm?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/cff63be2edb23fb97fb048ea69d9378a.webp?t=1713179908\" /></div><br>Pick up the trash and throw it away into the dedicated containers. You can also decide just to burn it or dump it into the ocean, risking the island\u2019s wrath.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/55dd1f5c0f833286491fa3efffa97300.poster.avif?t=1713179908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/55dd1f5c0f833286491fa3efffa97300.webm?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/00d69175af944d891ccba93100be4cfc.webp?t=1713179908\" /></div><br>You can cut down trees, but make sure to plant new ones! The Camping Builder is all about balance.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/4519e5c7906e3f61b075d7312fcf3284.poster.avif?t=1713179908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/4519e5c7906e3f61b075d7312fcf3284.webm?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/b8ef609e39ac6494752610b15599d187.webp?t=1713179908\" /></div><br>Find out more about this beautiful place, meet its inhabitants and discover its mysteries. Fall in love with the world and the story.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/b656879d89598ff9803e4f057cdb1bac.poster.avif?t=1713179908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1545510/extras/b656879d89598ff9803e4f057cdb1bac.webm?t=1713179908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br>",
